  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-24",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "边边的投名状  (Bianbian's Peace Offering)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping outside after the meeting, Kaiwen thanks entertainment reporter Bianbian for tipping off Xingtian. Bianbian explains why he wants to reform and write an in-depth profile—until Kaiwen names his new contact person. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这才几分钟啊，凯文总就把那二位搞定了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "星天总编室的精英团队果然名不虚传啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "还是得谢谢编哥提供的信息啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你在网络广播上骂他，生怕别人听不着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你现在小有名气，不就是靠坑星天来的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "老写负面八卦没什么大出息，也是无奈之举，博个眼球嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我们做娱乐新闻的，将来要是想有长远发展。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "像星天这样的主流公司，才是最好的消息源。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "所以我愿意改邪归正，好好跟星天合作，先表达我的诚意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你想写星天的深度报道没问题，你得写正面报道，最后的稿子我们要审。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "没问题，能跟淳于老大合作，我一定好好珍惜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁告诉你是跟淳于总合作的？我给你找了公关部总监斯戴拉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你这不是整我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "就凭你给我们家淳于添那么多麻烦，我不该整你吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这才几分钟啊，凯文总就把那二位搞定了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That took only a few minutes, and Mr Kaiwen already sorted those two out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "星天总编室的精英团队果然名不虚传啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The elite team of Xingtian's chief editor's office truly lives up to its reputation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "还是得谢谢编哥提供的信息啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, I have to thank Brother Bianbian for the tip-off you provided.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你在网络广播上骂他，生怕别人听不着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You roasted him on online radio, practically afraid people might miss it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你现在小有名气，不就是靠坑星天来的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did your modest fame right now not come from ambushing Xingtian?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "老写负面八卦没什么大出息，也是无奈之举，博个眼球嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Writing negative gossip forever gets you nowhere; I only did it out of necessity to grab attention.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我们做娱乐新闻的，将来要是想有长远发展。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For those of us in entertainment news, if we want long-term growth in the future—'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "像星天这样的主流公司，才是最好的消息源。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'mainstream companies like Xingtian are the very best news source.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "所以我愿意改邪归正，好好跟星天合作，先表达我的诚意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I am ready to turn over a new leaf, cooperate properly with Xingtian, and show my sincerity first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你想写星天的深度报道没问题，你得写正面报道，最后的稿子我们要审。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Writing an in-depth feature on Xingtian is fine, provided it is positive coverage and we review the final draft.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "没问题，能跟淳于老大合作，我一定好好珍惜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem—getting to work with Boss Chun Yuqiao is something I will truly cherish.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁告诉你是跟淳于总合作的？我给你找了公关部总监斯戴拉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who told you it was with Mr Chun Yuqiao? I matched you with our PR director, Stella.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你这不是整我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you not setting me up to suffer?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "就凭你给我们家淳于添那么多麻烦，我不该整你吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After all the headaches you gave our Chun Yuqiao, do you not deserve a little payback?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
